This package is based on pi-zentui by Luka.
Original project: https://github.com/lmilojevicc/pi-zentui
License: MIT. Full license text: licenses/pi-zentui-MIT.txt

It also includes modified Sakura-macaron code derived from pi-claude-shimmer
by ouzhenkun.
Original project: https://github.com/ouzhenkun/pi-claude-shimmer
License: MIT. Full license text: licenses/pi-claude-shimmer-MIT.txt

Sakura additions include the Sakura Macaron theme, header, Matrix widget, and
Sakura-macaron shimmer styling. The embedded Zentui implementation remains the
package baseline; this package does not include a nested modified copy of
pi-zentui.
